  <h1>Native call bindings,<br />engineered for <em>Node.js</em>.</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    Thread-safe Rust N-API bindings for <code>libntgcalls</code> — the C-shared WebRTC library.
    Promise-based, EventEmitter-native, zero <code>LD_LIBRARY_PATH</code>. Works on Node.js and Bun.
  </p>

