<div class="eyebrow"><span class="seg">WHY</span><span class="bar"></span></div>

<div class="specs">
  <div class="spec">
    <div class="num">01</div>
    <h3>Thread-safe callbacks</h3>
    <p>Background native WebRTC thread events become event-loop tasks via N-API ThreadsafeFunction — crash-free.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="spec">
    <div class="num">02</div>
    <h3>Promise-based API</h3>
    <p>Heavy operations delegated to a Tokio threadpool through safe one-shot synchronization channels.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="spec">
    <div class="num">03</div>
    <h3>Smart ID mapping</h3>
    <p>Accepts a number or a bigint for Telegram chat/user IDs interchangeably — no manual conversions.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="spec">
    <div class="num">04</div>
    <h3>RPATH isolation</h3>
    <p>Resolves libntgcalls relative to the addon directory — no LD_LIBRARY_PATH needed, on any platform.</p>
  </div>
</div>

